{"release":{"id":171838153,"tag":"0.4.1","author":"carson-katri","name":"v0.4.1","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2024-08-25T15:19:28Z","publishedAt":"2024-08-26T02:23:12Z","markdown":"This release contains fixes for the render pass, model search/download, and ROCm dependencies.\r\n\r\n## Choose Your Installation\r\nSeparate versions are available depending on your GPU and Blender version.\r\n\r\nClick on the link to download the correct version:\r\n\r\n| | Blender 4.1+ | Blender 3.6 → 4.0 |\r\n| -------- | ------------ | ------------------------- |\r\n| **Windows** | | |\r\n| NVIDIA | [dream_textures-windows-cuda-4-1.7z](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-cuda-4-1.7z) | [dream_textures-windows-cuda.7z](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-cuda.7z) |\r\n| AMD/Other | [dream_textures-windows-directml-4-1.zip](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-directml-4-1.zip) | [dream_textures-windows-directml.zip](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-directml.zip) |\r\n| | | |\r\n| **macOS** | | |\r\n| Apple Silicon (M1+) | [dream_textures-macos-arm-4-1.zip](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-macos-arm-4-1.zip) | [dream_textures-macos-arm.zip](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-macos-arm.zip) |\r\n| | | |\r\n| **Linux** | | |\r\n| Any GPU | [Install Manually](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/wiki/Setting-Up-a-Development-Environment) | [Install Manually](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/wiki/Setting-Up-a-Development-Environment) |\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> ### Windows Installation Instructions\r\n> Due to file size limits on GitHub, the add-on ZIP file is contained in a 7-Zip archive.\r\n> 1. Install [7-Zip](https://www.7-zip.org/)\r\n> 2. Right-click on the downloaded `dream_textures-windows-cuda-*.7z` archive\r\n> 3. Select \"7-Zip\" > \"Extract Here\" to get the `dream_textures-windows-cuda-*.zip` file.\r\n> 4. In Blender preferences open \"Add-ons\" > \"Install...\"\r\n> 5. Choose the `dream_textures-windows-cuda-4-1.zip` file.\r\n\r\n## Setup\r\nAfter installing the appropriate add-on ZIP file, enable the add-on and expand its preferences. There you will find further instructions for setup.\r\n\r\nSee the [setup guide](https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/wiki/Setup) for more detailed instructions.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Fix Blender 4.1 Render Pass by @NullSenseStudio in https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/808\r\n* Update Hugging Face utilities by @Wauplin in https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/813\r\n* Remove `nightly` prefix from ROCm `extra-index-url` by @carson-katri in https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/811\r\n* Release v0.4.1 by @carson-katri in https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/816\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Wauplin made their first contribution in https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/813\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/compare/0.4.0...0.4.1","html":"<p>This release contains fixes for the render pass, model search/download, and ROCm dependencies.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">Choose Your Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-choose-your-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Choose Your Installation\" href=\"#choose-your-installation\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<p>Separate versions are available depending on your GPU and Blender version.</p>\n<p>Click on the link to download the correct version:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Blender 4.1+</th>\n<th>Blender 3.6 → 4.0</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Windows</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NVIDIA</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-cuda-4-1.7z\">dream_textures-windows-cuda-4-1.7z</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-cuda.7z\">dream_textures-windows-cuda.7z</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMD/Other</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-directml-4-1.zip\">dream_textures-windows-directml-4-1.zip</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-directml.zip\">dream_textures-windows-directml.zip</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>macOS</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple Silicon (M1+)</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-macos-arm-4-1.zip\">dream_textures-macos-arm-4-1.zip</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-macos-arm.zip\">dream_textures-macos-arm.zip</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Linux</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Any GPU</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/wiki/Setting-Up-a-Development-Environment\">Install Manually</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/wiki/Setting-Up-a-Development-Environment\">Install Manually</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[!IMPORTANT]</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\">Windows Installation Instructions</h3><a id=\"user-content-windows-installation-instructions\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Windows Installation Instructions\" href=\"#windows-installation-instructions\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<p>Due to file size limits on GitHub, the add-on ZIP file is contained in a 7-Zip archive.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Install <a href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\">7-Zip</a>\n</li>\n<li>Right-click on the downloaded <code>dream_textures-windows-cuda-*.7z</code> archive</li>\n<li>Select \"7-Zip\" &gt; \"Extract Here\" to get the <code>dream_textures-windows-cuda-*.zip</code> file.</li>\n<li>In Blender preferences open \"Add-ons\" &gt; \"Install...\"</li>\n<li>Choose the <code>dream_textures-windows-cuda-4-1.zip</code> file.</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">Setup</h2><a id=\"user-content-setup\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Setup\" href=\"#setup\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<p>After installing the appropriate add-on ZIP file, enable the add-on and expand its preferences. There you will find further instructions for setup.</p>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/wiki/Setup\">setup guide</a> for more detailed instructions.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix Blender 4.1 Render Pass by @NullSenseStudio in <a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/808\">https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/808</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update Hugging Face utilities by @Wauplin in <a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/813\">https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/813</a>\n</li>\n<li>Remove <code>nightly</code> prefix from ROCm <code>extra-index-url</code> by @carson-katri in <a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/811\">https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/811</a>\n</li>\n<li>Release v0.4.1 by @carson-katri in <a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/816\">https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/816</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">New Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-new-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: New Contributors\" href=\"#new-contributors\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>@Wauplin made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/813\">https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/pull/813</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/compare/0.4.0...0.4.1\">https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/compare/0.4.0...0.4.1</a></p>\n","assets":[{"contentType":"application/zip","size":399039094,"createdAt":"2024-08-25T16:11:46Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-25T16:13:28Z","downloadCount":3915,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-macos-arm-4-1.zip"},{"contentType":"application/zip","size":356108747,"createdAt":"2024-08-25T16:10:08Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-25T16:11:45Z","downloadCount":745,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-macos-arm.zip"},{"contentType":"application/x-7z-compressed","size":1826192283,"createdAt":"2024-08-26T00:36:09Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-26T01:02:13Z","downloadCount":40504,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-cuda-4-1.7z"},{"contentType":"application/x-7z-compressed","size":1810956602,"createdAt":"2024-08-26T00:03:50Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-26T00:31:23Z","downloadCount":5709,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-cuda.7z"},{"contentType":"application/zip","size":726705195,"createdAt":"2024-08-25T16:03:42Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-25T16:06:50Z","downloadCount":8336,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-directml-4-1.zip"},{"contentType":"application/zip","size":696021035,"createdAt":"2024-08-25T16:06:50Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-25T16:10:08Z","downloadCount":1845,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/carson-katri/dream-textures/releases/download/0.4.1/dream_textures-windows-directml.zip"}]}}